     "text": "But a recent report released by the agency has left some experts with substantial doubts about its researchers' methods, its claims about its findings and its authors' political intentions. The report , titled \"Where the Clinic Meets the Movement: Does Gender Ideology Arm Left-Wing Authoritarian Psychology?\" was not peer reviewed and its underlying data and funding have also not been made available. All are common best practices for research. (One author says its data will be released \"soon.\")",
